# BK Clincher: lean on him for 25 rounds (tuned -1/+0)
3B/8/8 (clinch)
if opponent <= tired then 3B/9/7 (clinch)
if opponent = exhausted then 3B/10/6 (clinch)
if round >= 20 and opponent = exhausted then 4B/10/5 (clinch)
if round = 25 then 4H/10/5 (clinch)
if endurance_percent < 30 then 2/3/15 (clinch)

# Dancer: stick, move and never stand still (tuned +0/-1)
5H/4/10 (ring)
if round <= 3 then 4H/3/12 (ring)
if opponent = exhausted then 7H/7/5
if score < 0 and round >= 7 then 6H/5/8 (ring)
if score > 2*(1 + 12 - round) then 2/2/16 (ring)
if endurance_percent < 45 then 4/3/13 (ring)

